<title>NETHERLANDS: RESEARCH-Suez reiterates Vendex as a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH-Suez reiterates Vendex as a buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Jan 7 research.</p>
<p>Company----Sector-------------Price--------Broker-------</p>
<p>Vendex     Retail, services   81.00	  Suez Nederland</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy (vs Buy). Acquisition of BIS to strengthen Vendex' market position in Europe and have positive effect on EPS. Split-up to lead to a re-rating of the stock. Price target 90 guilders.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	 P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995/96 (actual)   4.33	18.7     1.50</p>
<p>    1996/97		4.71	17.2     1.65</p>
<p>    1997/98		5.59	14.5     1.85</p>
<p>    1998/99		5.73	14.1     1.85</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
